y and armourers had the opportunity to develop their skills and their patrons could reveal personal taste in the fine fittings of their processional armour."@en , "120-plate russet iron helmet with neck-guard (J. <i>shikoro</i>)"@en , "H R Robinson (formerly Keeper of the Royal Armouries)"@en ;
